      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Caverns of Endless Song [zone=1018]\n**Who:**\n- Brother Dilgen [npc=47715]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 00:06:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Chastity Helmet Set [item=119525]\n- Crocolisk Hide [item=120695]\n- Salty Rusted Sword [item=120684]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Brother Jurgum [npc=47753]\n- Brother Stanlop [npc=47754]\n- Brother Strapp [npc=47755]\n- Brother Vek`Nal [npc=47756]\n- a brother`s keeper [npc=47987]\n- a brother`s possessor [npc=47988]\n- a skeletal acolyte [npc=48009]\n- a skeletal evoker [npc=48010]\n- a skeletal minion [npc=48011]\n- a skeletal thrall [npc=48012]\n- a skeletal wizard [npc=48013]\n- a vicious crocolisk [npc=48019]\n- an enraged crocolisk [npc=48049]\n**Related Quests:**\n- TDS Progression #0: An Overview [quest=7701]\n- TDS Progression #10: Two Sides of the Shield [quest=7712]\n- TDS Progression #8: Loyal is the Heart [quest=7710]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 02:54:57 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nThis solo task begins with Brother Dilgen ( **click for map image**) in the cave just north of the zone-in.\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- Completion of \"A Rising Storm\" (Tempest Temple)\n\\- Completion of \"Gathering Clouds\" (Tempest Temple)\n\\- Completion of \"Clearer Skies\" (Tempest Temple)\n\\- Completion of \"The Edge of Balance\" (Katta Castrum: Deluge)\n\\- Completion of \"The Abscent Scholar\" (Katta Castrum: Deluge)\n\\- Completion of \"Just Recompense\" (Brother Island)\n\\- Completion of \"The Cover of Night\" (Brother Island)\n\\- Completion of \"Loyal is the Heart\" (Caverns of Endless Song)\nSay obtain to request the task.\nYou say, 'Hail, Brother Dilgen'\nBrother Dilgen says 'Then Dagda will not help [rescue] my brothers? Quigley told me you owed us... maybe you're someone who actually knows how to honor a debt.' Dilgen's fist clenches. 'Honor... and what does Horace know of such a word? He kills his own brothers! If a brother falls, we must [raise] him to his feet not bury him in the ground!'\nYou say, 'How do we raise them?'\nBrother Dilgen says 'We often find sufficient force can knock a brother's senses back into him. But right now I don't have enough weapons to arm the brothers you save. They were taken in the middle of the night, and most will be defenseless. They'll need a way to [fight back] and defend against any more attempts the sirens might make to enthrall them.'\nYou say, 'Fight back?'\nBrother Dilgen says 'The undead that wander the caverns won't miss their weapons, and the hides of crocolisks will provide protection. Can you [obtain] these?'\nYou say, 'Yes... I'll obtain them...'\nBrother Dilgen says 'Good. There may still be hope for my brothers!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Leave No Brother Behind'.\nBrother Dilgen wants you to collect supplies and help save his brothers from the sirens.\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\nLoot swords for the brothers from the skeletons in the caverns 0/4 (Caverns of Endless Song)\n\"Salty Rusted Sword\" can drop from any regular skeleton or floating skeleton mob (very common or 100% drop rate).\nGive the swords to Brother Dilgen 0/4 (Caverns of Endless Song)\nBrother Dilgen says 'My brothers will gladly wield these once their minds have been freed.'\nTake hardened hides from the crocolisks 0/4 (Caverns of Endless Song)\nCrocolisks are found in the same cavern as Brother Dilgen as well as the above-water area to the east. They tend to hit for a max ~17,000 and are mezzable.\nGive the hardened hides to Brother Dilgen 0/4 (Caverns of Endless Song)\nBrother Dilgen flexes the tough hides. They barely bend. 'These will do. They won't be proper helmets, but they'll suffice.'\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Brother Dilgen 0/2 (Caverns of Endless Song)\nHail him until the task updates.\nBrother Dilgen hands you a set of crudely constructed helms that resemble the helmets worn by the brothers. 'These aren't up to the quality standards of our everyday chastity helmets, but we have no other choices. You might notice the lack of visor. Tell the brothers to watch their feet.'\nBrother Dilgen says 'We're still missing Brother Stanlop, Brother Vek`nal, Brother Jurgum, and Brother Strapp. Knock some sense into them and make them put on the helmets.'\nYou receive a Chastity Helmet Set [item=119525].\n\n---\n\nWeaken Brother Stanlop and place the helmet on him 0/1 (Caverns of Endless Song)\nWeaken Brother Vek`Nal and place the helmet on him 0/1 (Caverns of Endless Song)\nWeaken Brother Jurgum and place the helmet on him 0/1 (Caverns of Endless Song)\nWeaken Brother Strapp and place the helmet on him 0/1 (Caverns of Endless Song)\nThese steps are all open at once. Three of the Brothers are in the cavern to the west, and another is in the cavern to the north. Each Brother is leashed to within about 100' range of their spawn point, hits for a max ~12,000, and is immune to mez. Each has 1-2 sirens next to him (hit for a max ~6,000; immune to mez; sirens are NOT leashed). All three mobs are aggro-linked.\na brother's possessor is mezzable\nKilling the sirens is optional (they respawn rather fast and have a lot of hitpoints). DPS the Brother to under 50% health, and then click the helmet on them (if you're in a group, this updates everyone who's on this step):\nBrother Stanlop covers his eyes and ears. 'Must not look! Must not hear!' He runs for the cavern entrance without looking.\nNOTE: If you need these task updates, you must be on the Brother's hate list or else it won't update for you.\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Brother Dilgen 0/1 (Caverns of Endless Song)\nYou say, 'Hail, Brother Dilgen'\nBrother Dilgen says 'The brothers are safe, and Quigley will be pleased. But what of the next attack that will surely come, and the one after that? I have been thinking about this Queen Silisia of whom you spoke. She must be stopped. Brother Visius has some... interesting ideas...'\nReward(s):\nExperience\n75 platinum\nThis task is repeatable with a 6-hour lockout from the time of request.",
