      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Caverns of Endless Song [zone=1018]\n**Who:**\n- Ellen Kwiklen [npc=47718]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 105\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Rockhorn Beetle Corpse [item=120694]\n- Spineback Meat [item=120693]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a beetle den [npc=48041]\n- a beetle nest [npc=48042]\n- a hornrock beetle [npc=48043]\n- a vicious spineback [npc=48021]\n- an adolescent spineback [npc=48025]\n- an enraged spineback [npc=48034]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Ellen Kwiklen #2: Fishy Fingers [quest=7743]\n- Ellen Kwiklen #3: Endless Silence [quest=7744]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 03:36:03 2014\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This solo task is the first in a series of three begins with Ellen Kwiklen ( **click for map image**) in the Caverns of Endless Song. She is located in the small area above water just south of the underwater zone-in tunnel._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- None\n_Say \"food chain\" to request the task._\nYou say, 'Hail, Ellen Kwiklen'\nEllen Kwiklen says 'Can you feel it \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_? The angst and tension in the air? As if a great storm is about to break and deluge the world in an angry torrent of cleansing water and lightning. The kedge of the Tempest Temple may be extreme in their methods, but at least they understand that sometimes chaos is the [natural order] of things.'\nYou say, 'Natural order?'\nEllen Kwiklen says 'Yes...I just said that. Anyway. The order here has been disturbed. The sirens' presence in these caverns has sent the prior inhabitants into a stupefied haze of enraged anger. As if the magic of their songs has muddled their instincts through long exposure. The order must be restored \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_, here, and everywhere. Will you help me heal the wounds of this [defiled sanctuary]?'\nYou say, 'Defiled sanctuary?'\nEllen Kwiklen says 'I...wait...is that a yes? I can't tell with you. You just keep repeating my words back to me. I'm going to go out on a limb and assume you'll help me. If we're going to fix the natural order here we'll have to start at the bottom and work our way up. Of the [food chain] that is.'\nYou say, 'Food chain?'\nEllen Kwiklen sighs heavily. 'It's like listening to my own voice echoing off the cave walls. In any case, the first thing we need to do is get the animals back following their instincts, and for most of the creatures here that means hunting. Normally I'd smack you over the head for killing animals, but we need to jump start their instincts. Collect a stack of spikeback meat, you'll need quite a few good sized pieces. Next you'll need to take those steaks and set them on hornback beetle dens. That should draw them out and remind them of their carrion instincts. Be ready for them to be rather ravenous. If they try to make you their next meal, don't hesitate to defend yourself. It's all in the natural order of things. Once you've handled that come back and we'll talk about what's next.\nYou have been assigned the task 'Natural Instincts'.\nEllen Kwiklen is very worried about the native creatures of the caverns, and how they've been affected by the sirens as well as the undead in the area. She wants you to help restore the natural order by kick starting the animal's natural instincts.\nStart by placing spineback meat on the beetle dens in the caverns.\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\nCollect hornback beetle corpses 0/10 (Caverns of Endless Song)\n_Kill spinebacks (turepta mobs) and loot \"Spineback Meat\" (dropped about one in every three spineback kills - confirmed from \"an enraged spineback\" and \"a vicious spineback\" - maybe others too). Then 'give' the meat to \"a beetle den\" or \"a beetle nest\" that are scattered about the above-water caverns in the zone (a lot of spinebacks and beetle nests are located in the caverns east and west of those that house Brothers Dilgen and Visius)._\n_Upon handing in Spineback Meat, 3-6 \"a hornrock beetle\" spawn:_\nA number of tiny bugs begin to squirm their way out of the nest. Tentatively at first, but once they notice the meat they begin to swarm.\n_These are trivial mobs (mezzable and stunnable; hit for a max ~800). Drop rate for \"Rockhorn Beetle Corpse\" may depend on the number of players in the group who are on the same task step._\n\n---\n\nDeliver the hornback beetle corpses to Ellen Kwiklen 0/10 (Caverns of Endless Song)\nWell done. These beetle corpses will come in handy for the next step of my master plan. You've done some mushroom farming in the past I'm certain? No?! Well there's no time like the [present].\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\n112 platinum, 5 gold\n_This task is repeatable with a 6-hour lockout from the time of request._",
