      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Caverns of Endless Song [zone=1018]\n**Who:**\n- Mough Kyslaz [npc=47719]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 03:00:00\n**Related Zones:**\n- Caverns of Endless Song: Seductive Subterfuge [zone=1027]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Elizabeth Ruffleberg [npc=47680]\n- Mough Kyslaz [ _Contact_]\n- a cyclone elemental [npc=48403]\n- a sea elemental [npc=48404]\n- a seduced corsair [npc=48405]\n- a seduced druid - Caverns of Endless Song - 2 [npc=48406]\n- a seduced marauder [npc=48407]\n- a seduced pirate [npc=48408]\n- a seduced raider [npc=48409]\n- a seduced warden [npc=48410]\n- a silenced enchantress [npc=48411]\n- a silenced evoker [npc=48412]\n- a silenced siren [npc=48413]\n- a silenced witch [npc=48414]\n- a skeletal acolyte [npc=48415]\n- a skeletal evoker [npc=48416]\n- a skeletal minion [npc=48417]\n- a skeletal thrall [npc=48418]\n- a skeletal wizard [npc=48419]\n- a vicious barracuda [npc=48420]\n- a vicious bladefish [npc=48421]\n- a vicious hammerhead [npc=48422]\n- a vicious spineback [npc=48423]\n- a voiceless temptress [npc=48424]\n- a wailing spirit [npc=48425]\n- a water elemental - Caverns of Endless Song - 2 [npc=48426]\n- an adolescent spineback [npc=48427]\n- an air elemental - Caverns of Endless Song - 2 [npc=48428]\n- an enraged crocolisk [npc=48429]\n- an enraged spineback [npc=48430]\n- an enticing spirit [npc=48431]\n**Era:** | !The Darkened Sea\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 26 03:37:49 2014\nModified: Sat Jun 21 20:22:18 2025 |\n---\n\n**The Darkened Sea Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n**About Heroic Adventures:**\n\\- They use the task system (steps are shown in task window, but steps are only revealed as you get to them).\n\\- Scale in difficulty, loot quality, and mob levels (based on your group's highest level player - as low as 85).\n\\- Tuned for 2-3 players and their mercenaries.\n\\- Nameds can spawn as you progress through the task (you usually have to complete a few steps before this can happen).\n\\- Collection items can drop from mobs in the instances, and ground spawns appear midway through tasks.\n\\- Expected time of completion will vary by your group's makeup (anywhere from 30-90+ minutes).\n\\- There is some variations/randomization in the task steps you'll be assigned as you progress through the task.\n**About Our Documentation of Heroic Adventures**\n\\- We only display task steps we know about.\n\\-\\-\\- If you encounter a step that isn't documented here, please post the details (or email us) and **be sure to indicate which step number it was** so that we can display it in its proper place.\n\n---\n\n_This is a heroic adventure (1-6 players) that begins with Mough Kyslaz ( **click for map image**) in the Caverns of Endless Song (located in the area south of the zone-in)._\n_Pre-Requisites for Requesting:_\n\\- None\n\n---\n\n**TASK SUMMARY**\n\\- Say \"song\" to request the task and \"ready\" to zone in.\n**Step #1:**\nClear the tunnels of aggressive sea life 0/14\n\\-\\-\\- Kill update.\nEliminate the seduced 0/20\n\\-\\-\\- Kill update.\n**Step #2:**\nBanish the skeletons, spirits, and banshees 0/11\n\\-\\-\\- Kill update.\nPut the sirens to rest 0/10\n\\-\\-\\- Kill update.\nEliminate the enthralled 0/9\n\\-\\-\\- Kill update.\nDestroy the elementals 0/8\n\\-\\-\\- Kill update.\n**At this point in the task, collectibles appear as ground spawns and a named (Elizabeth Ruffleberg or its PH a voiceless temptress) has a chance to appear.**\n**Step #3:**\nSpeak to Mough Kyslaz 0/1\n\\-\\-\\- Hail update to finish.\n\n---\n\n!\n\n---\n\n**NAMED MOBS**\n_\"Elizabeth Ruffleberg\" (or its PH, \"a voiceless temptress\") spawns after the second step is completed. This mob appears inside the large purple coral in the eastern part of the zone._\n_Known loot from this named:_\nLevel 105\nSeaweed Earring\nSiren's Stone\nLevel 100\n???\nLevel 95\n???\n\n---\n\n**TASK IN DETAIL**\n========================================================================\nTRIGGERING THE TASK\n========================================================================\nYou say, 'Hail, Mough Kyslaz'\nMough Kyslaz says 'Yeah? You another one of them [adventurers] lookin' for any job that pays?'\nYou say, 'Adventurers?'\nYou suddenly take note of Mough's surprisingly unattractive face as he turns to speak to you. 'Yeah well yer used to this. There's somethin' I want and can't get but maybe you can. That siren's song lures out all kinds of folk and not one of them seems too upset about how hideous them sirens is. You bring me back that [song] and I got a fair prize for ya.'\nYou say, 'Yes... I'll get the song...'\nMough Kyslaz says 'Good, tell me when yer [ready] to go.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Seductive Subterfuge'.\nMough Kyslaz has been tormented by his own appearance since birth. He believes his luck will change if you are able to capture the siren's song for him.\nYou say, 'Ready!'\nMough Kyslaz says 'Good luck down there.'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Caverns of Endless Song.\n========================================================================\nSTEP #1\n========================================================================\nClear the tunnels of aggressive sea life 0/14 (Caverns of Endless Song)\n_Task Window Says:_ As you make your way through the treacherous caves you will no doubt encounter the vicious sea life that roam the depths. Kill any sharks, swordfish or barracudas that get in your way.\n_If You Get This Step: Kill update._\n=====================\nEliminate the seduced 0/20 (Caverns of Endless Song)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Kill update._\n========================================================================\nSTEP #2\n========================================================================\nEliminate the seduced\nTask Window Says: As you make your way through the treacherous caves will no doubt run into the love struck marauders that have gotten themselves captured and enraptured by the siren's song. Put these poor fools out of their misery!\nDestroy the elementals\nTask Window Says: Mough has had no luck in finding the source of the seductive siren's song but he has one last hope. He thinks the song has been stolen by the reclusive elementals that dwell deep within the cavern. 'See what sound those creatures make when you smash their bodies to bits!\nBanish the skeletons, spirits, and banshees 0/11 (Caverns of Endless Song)\n_Task Window Says:_ Mough had no luck in finding the source of the seductive siren's song but he has a theory. He believes that the song has been hidden in the spirits of the undead that haunt the eastern halls of the cavern. 'See what sounds the skeletons and spirits make when you banish them into nothingness!'\n_If You Get This Step: Kill update._\n=====================\nPut the sirens to rest 0/10 (Caverns of Endless Song)\n_Task Window Says:_ Mough believes that one of the sirens still holds the power of seductive song and that their 'silence' is just an act. He would like you to beat the song out of these deepwater temptresses.\n_If You Get This Step: Kill update._\n=====================\nEliminate the enthralled 0/9 (Caverns of Endless Song)\n_Task Window Says:_ Mough thinks that the enthralled that have taken to the song of the siren have been blessed with its haunting tune. He would like you to find every 'enthralled' inhabitant and try to steal the song from their stilled hearts. 'If they refuse to sing then do away with them!'\n_If You Get This Step: Kill update. \"Enthralled\" mobs are found in a very specific part of the zone. In the above map image, they are in the small circular rooms reached via connections \"N\" and \"P\"._\n=====================\nDestroy the elementals 0/8 (Caverns of Endless Song)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Kill update your find 8 Water Elemental's in the NW area. (M) on the Map above. ._\n========================================================================\nSTEP #3\n========================================================================\nSpeak to Mough Kyslaz 0/1 (Caverns of Endless Song)\n_Task Window Says:_ ?\n_If You Get This Step: Hail Mough at the zone-in to complete._\n\n---\n\n**TASK REWARDS**\n\\- 38 - 51 \"Pieces of Eight\" (group currency)\n- Piece of Eight [item=120483]\n- Seaweed Earring [item=121777]\n- Siren's Stone [item=121467]\n- Tideworn Bracer [item=120702]",
